Bootstrap
---------

To bootstrap modules for a new python version, build 'setuptools' and 'pip'
with the '-f bootstrap' flag, and install them:

    for m in setuptools pip; do
	{ cd $m; ./build.sh -f bootstrap -blt; cd ..; }
    done
    pfexec pkg install pip-3XX setuptools-3XX

then build again, without the bootstrap flag, and update the installed
packages:

    for m in setuptools pip; do
	{ cd $m; ./build.sh -blt; cd ..; }
    done
    pfexec pkg update pip-3XX setuptools-3XX
